# MetroKit xeokit visual

- Use `@xeokit/xeokit-sdk` `Viewer`, `XKTLoaderPlugin`, `GLTFLoaderPlugin`, `WebIFCLoaderPlugin`, `NavCubePlugin`.
- Keep one Viewer; resize the canvas on Power BI resize; `viewer.destroy()` only in `destroy()`.
- Prefer XKT for large IFC. Parse IFC in-browser only for small files.
- NavCube needs its own canvas (`canvasElement`), not the main viewer canvas.
- Pair `settings.ts` slice names with `capabilities.json`.
- Model URLs need `WebAccess`. Work in `MetroKit/`.
